            "name": "ape_mint",
            "docs": [
              "`Pubkey::default()` until the token launches. Nothing burns before then."
            ],
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "mint_price",
            "docs": [
              "`h`, in lamports."
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "minted",
            "docs": [
              "`f` — brokers hired. The burn is `h * f`, so this is the whole story."
